# App Refinement & Cooking Mode

Pivot the application to focus on three core user journeys: Planning, Shopping, and Cooking. Move administrative tasks (Pantry, Recipes) to a management section.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The Root URL (`/`) will now redirect to the **Planner** instead of a Dashboard.

## Proposed Changes

### Navigation & Routing
- **[MODIFY] [Layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/Layout.tsx)**: 
    - Sidebar prioritized for "Operations": Planner, Shopping, and Cooking.
    - Sidebar bottom section for "Library": Pantry and Recipes.
- **[MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/App.tsx)**: 
    - Root (`/`) redirects to `/planner`.
    - Routes for `/cooking` and `/cooking/:mealId`.
    - Maintenance of `/pantry` and `/recipes` routes, moved under the Library navigation.

### Library (Pantry & Recipes CRUD)
- Handled via a focused "Library" view or dedicated entries at the bottom of the sidebar.
- **Recipes**: Full CRUD (Create/Read/Update/Delete) via existing `RecipeListPage` and `RecipeEditor`.
- **Pantry**: Full management of ingredients and categories via `IngredientsPage`.
- **Integration**: While these are ad-hoc, they will use the same Zen Minimal look for consistency but without the "daily operations" priority.

### Cooking Feature
- **[NEW] [CookingPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/pages/cooking/CookingPage.tsx)**: Overview of planned meals for the current day. Provides an entry point to Cooking Mode.
- **[NEW] [CookingMode.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/pages/cooking/CookingMode.tsx)**: Focused interface for meal preparation.
    - Ingredient checklist for mise en place.
    - High-readability instructions.
    - Persistent timer sidebar.

### Cleanup
- **[DELETE] [Dashboard.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/pages/Dashboard.tsx)**: Remove the generic dashboard as it's no longer needed.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Verify routing transitions between the three pillars.
- Check that recipe data correctly hydrates the Cooking Mode specifically for the selected meal.

### Manual Verification
- Walk through the journey: Planner -> Shopping -> Cooking.
- Test "Cooking Mode" responsiveness on mobile (essential for the kitchen).
